            "description": {
              "content": "### Requests an identity verification for a person.\r\n\r\nProvide the `person_id`, and optionally specify the `country_code` if you already know the country of issue for the document to be provided.\r\n\r\nThis returns Sikoia's `verification_url` and an IDV provider's `direct_url` (if the country is specified in the request). Both URLs can be used to commence the identity verification process.\r\n",
              "type": "text/plain"
            },
            "url": {
